 Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229479,"global_rank":113673,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19691},{"name":"SebasRod23/cool-antlr","owner":"SebasRod23","html_url":"https://github.com/SebasRod23/cool-antlr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229477,"global_rank":113679,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19692},{"name":"nonabelian/leapy","owner":"nonabelian","html_url":"https://github.com/nonabelian/leapy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"BETA: Real-time inference from scalable machine learning in Python","topics":["dask","dask-ml","data-science","inference","machine-learning","pipeline","pipelines","real-time","realtime"],"score":229476,"global_rank":231100,"on_pypi":true,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19693},{"name":"tylerl/SublimeFilters","owner":"tylerl","html_url":"https://github.com/tylerl/SublimeFilters","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"My custom filters for the SublimeText FilterPipes plugin","topics":[],"score":229470,"global_rank":113684,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19694},{"name":"NOAA-PMEL/erddap_refresh","owner":"NOAA-PMEL","html_url":"https://github.com/NOAA-PMEL/erddap_refresh","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229463,"global_rank":113695,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":19695},{"name":"ephraimrothschild/Neural-Network-Tools","owne